nces near 96 percent. No public general-election polls are available, so the outlook rests on fundamentals, but the accumulated evidence points to a comfortable Scholten win.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9846, "margin": 15.07}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9771, "margin": 14.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9808, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9798, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9738, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.976, "margin": 15.2}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9772, "margin": 14.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9828, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.972, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9845, "margin": 14.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9808, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9812, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9777, "margin": 14.5}]}